  "final_answer": "I found all the information needed. The page on iforgot.apple.com clearly states the password reset process for forgotten Apple Account passwords.\n\n**Important information captured:**\n- Current page: iforgot.apple.com (password reset page)\n- Page text: \"你可以在此处重设忘记的密码。出于安全原因，我们将向你提几个问题，以验证该账户属于你。\" (You can reset your forgotten password here. For security reasons, we will ask you a few questions to verify that the account belongs to you.)\n- Form fields: Email or phone number input, CAPTCHA input\n- Buttons: \"新代码\" (New code), \"视力障碍\" (Visual impairment accessibility)\n\nI now have enough information to provide the complete answer.\n\n---\n\n## Task Completed ✓\n\nI found the official Apple solution for resetting a forgotten Apple ID (Apple Account) password.\n\n### Solution Found on Apple's Website\n\n**Page:** iforgot.apple.com (also accessible via Apple's support site under \"Forgot your password?\" → \"Reset your password\" link)\n\n**The text on Apple's official reset page states (translated):**\n> \"You can reset your forgotten password here. For security reasons, we will ask you a few questions to verify that the account belongs to you.\"\n\n### Steps to Reset Your Forgotten Apple ID Password:\n\n1. **Go to** [iforgot.apple.com](https://iforgot.apple.com) — Apple's official Apple Account recovery page.\n2. **Enter your Apple ID** — provide the email address or phone number associated with your Apple Account.\n3. **Complete the CAPTCHA** — type the characters shown in the image (a new code option is available, plus an accessibility option for visually impaired users).\n4. **Verify your identity** — Apple will ask security questions to verify the account belongs to you.\n5. **Choose a password reset method** — typically via:\n   - Email to your rescue/backup email\n   - SMS to your trusted phone number\n   - Answering security questions\n   - Using two-factor authentication on a trusted device\n6. **Create a new password** following Apple's password requirements, then sign in.\n\n### Alternative Entry Points on apple.com:\n- From the Apple homepage footer, go to **Support → Apple ID → Forgot your password?**\n- Apple Support article: \"If you forgot your Apple Account password or password isn't working\"",
